# ===== Unreal Engine 5 project .gitignore =====
# Template from GameTech-Lab/templates/ue5. Copy to the project root (next to the .uproject).

# --- Generated build output and caches ---
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Build/*
# Keep platform settings that live under Build/ (icons, manifests, etc.)
!Build/*/
Build/*/**
!Build/*/Resources/
!Build/*/Resources/**
!Build/*/*.plist
!Build/*/*.xml
!Build/*/*.ini

# --- Plugin build output (project plugins under Plugins/) ---
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# --- IDE / solution files (regenerate via "Generate Visual Studio project files") ---
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# --- Compiled / intermediate files ---
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
# (*.obj is not ignored: it is also a 3D model format, tracked via LFS. Compiled .obj files live in Intermediate/.)
*.pch
*.gch
*.ipch
*.pdb
*.exp
*.ilk
*.lib
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe
*.app
*.target
*.modules
*.debug
*.dSYM

# --- Packaged builds ---
Packaged/
Releases/
Archive/
*.pak
*.ucas
*.utoc

# --- Starter content cache and misc ---
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Exceptions ---
# Prebuilt third-party libraries checked in under ThirdParty/ (tracked via LFS)
!**/ThirdParty/**
Content/Developers/

# Python bytecode from the asset scripts
__pycache__/
